cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Susanoo in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Susanoo: adaptive workflows and guardrails for Claude Code"
abstract: >-
  Susanoo (formerly DevRoute) is an open-source workflow layer for Claude Code. It rates a
  coding task's complexity and risk with deterministic, explainable heuristics, routes it to a
  FAST, STANDARD, or DEEP workflow with mandatory safety controls, and can enforce plan approval
  and verified test evidence through Claude Code hooks.
authors:
  - name: "Susanoo contributors"
version: 0.5.0
date-released: "2026-10-13"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Breadstick-Crumbs/susanoo"
url: "https://github.com/Breadstick-Crumbs/susanoo"
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - ai-coding-assistant
  - developer-tools
  - guardrails
  - software-engineering-workflow
